{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_152_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "33fcdf3b07c436c76fd57ab9bc7d2e909a8c74b4c33022c8e87ab08adb355734", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん、\n昨日のラジオ聞いたよ！\n最近すっごく活躍してるね！", "zh": "茱莉亚，我听了昨天的广播哦！\n最近表现得特别活跃呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
